{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"意象的点"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"意象的点"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>意象 $\\mathcal C$ 的<strong>点</strong>是点对应的意象 $\\mathsf{Set}$ (或 $\\infty$-范畴语境下, "},{"Local":{"url":"Ani","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":") 到 $\\mathcal C$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"几何态射","text":"几何态射"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}